      "description": "AniIsland transforms your Dynamic Island into a personal expression space. Whether it's your favorite character, a custom logo, a photo of someone you love, or a looping animated GIF — AniIsland puts it front and center on your island, always visible, always yours.\nHow it works:\nPick any image from your photo library — JPEG, PNG, or GIF. Hit Go Live. Exit the app. That's it. Your icon lives on the Dynamic Island until you decide to change it or take it down.\nGIF support:\nSelect an animated GIF and AniIsland will loop it on your island in real time while the app runs in the background. Bring your island to life.\nClean and simple:\nNo accounts. No subscriptions. No clutter. Just your image, your island, your vibe.\nWorks with:\niPhone 14 Pro, iPhone 15, iPhone 15 Pro, iPhone 16, iPhone 16 Pro, iPhone 17 and all models with the Dynamic Island.",
